  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Each of the persons A and B independently tosses three fair coins.&nbsp;</p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi></math>&nbsp;be the number of heads obtained by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi></math>&nbsp;be the number of heads obtained by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>.</p><p>Both&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi></math>&nbsp;are binomial variate with parameters,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Probability that both&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;obtain the same number of heads</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>1